    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98003" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγχορτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with the grass
			joining</i>, i.e. <i>bordering upon, marching with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθόνα σύγχορτον Συρίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Οἰνόῃ σύγχορτα . . πεδία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					179
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγχορτοι Ὀμόλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HF</u>
					371
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φθίας . . καὶ πόλεως
				Φαρσαλίας σύγχορτα . . πεδία</span>, i.e. <i>the
			marches</i> or <i>boundaries</i> of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
